---
import EditorialShell from '../../components/EditorialShell.astro';
import DaysTimeline from '../../components/DaysTimeline.astro';

const currentUrl = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site ?? 'https://shivammahajan.com').href;
const structuredData = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'CollectionPage',
      '@id': `${currentUrl}#collection`,
      isPartOf: { '@id': 'https://shivammahajan.com/#website' },
      url: currentUrl,
      name: 'Days of Code Milestones | Shivam Mahajan',
      description: "Explore key milestone days, century markers, and achievements across Shivam Mahajan's multi-year 2,002 Days of Code software engineering journey."
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      '@id': `${currentUrl}#breadcrumb`,
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://shivammahajan.com/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Blog', item: 'https://shivammahajan.com/blog/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Milestones', item: currentUrl }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<EditorialShell title="Days of Code milestones | Shivam Mahajan" description="Explore key milestone days, century markers, and achievements across Shivam Mahajan's multi-year 2,002 Days of Code software engineering journey." eyebrow="Field notes / Milestones" heading="Milestones" intro="Key milestone days, century markers, and achievements across the streak." image="/peony-gold-1200x630.png" imageAlt="Shivam Mahajan LinkedIn profile photo - antique gold peony" structuredData={structuredData}>
  <section class="prose milestone-deep-prose">
    <h2>Engineering Milestones &amp; Architectural Progression</h2>
    <p>
      The <strong>2,002 Days of Code</strong> challenge represents an unbroken, multi-year discipline in rigorous software craftsmanship, continuous algorithmic practice, and deterministic systems engineering. What originated as a daily commitment to master fundamental computational complexity and data structures has developed into an extensive technical knowledge base spanning distributed event streaming, low-level WebAssembly engines, high-concurrency enterprise pipelines, and automated reverse-engineering workbenches.
    </p>
    <p>
      Across more than five years of continuous daily commits and public engineering logs, this journey documents over <strong>2,680 algorithmic problem breakdowns</strong> across competitive platforms, production data pipelines scaling to <strong>5 million daily streaming events</strong> at Morgan Stanley, and zero-dependency client-side runtimes. Each century benchmark marks a deliberate paradigm shift in technical depth and architectural complexity.
    </p>

    <h2>Five Eras of Technical Evolution</h2>
    <div class="milestone-eras-grid">
      <div class="era-card">
        <span class="era-tag">Days 1 – 200 · Core Foundations</span>
        <h3>Data Structures &amp; Complexity Analysis</h3>
        <p>Mastering asymptotic complexity benchmarks, recursion trees, two-pointer traversals, sliding windows, monotonic queues, and amortized hash structures. Establishing foundational problem-solving intuition across competitive programming platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era-card">
        <span class="era-tag">Days 201 – 500 · Advanced Algorithms</span>
        <h3>Dynamic Programming &amp; Graph Theory</h3>
        <p>Deep exploration of optimal substructure: 1D and 2D state memoization, knapsack variations, longest common subsequences, Dijkstra's shortest path, Tarjan's strongly connected components, and topological sorting across complex dependency graphs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era-card">
        <span class="era-tag">Days 501 – 800 · Distributed Infrastructure</span>
        <h3>Streaming Architectures &amp; Real-Time Data</h3>
        <p>Building high-throughput enterprise pipelines at Morgan Stanley utilizing Apache Kafka, PySpark, and Snowflake. Implementing deterministic schema validation, zero-discrepancy row-count reconciliation, and exactly-once streaming processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era-card">
        <span class="era-tag">Days 801 – 1,100 · Systems &amp; Compilers</span>
        <h3>Low-Level Engines &amp; WebAssembly</h3>
        <p>Engineering zero-dependency systems in pure C99 and WebAssembly (Terminal Wordle), offline-first Android native applications with Jetpack Compose (Productivity Caller), and reverse-engineering platforms with AST-based decompilation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era-card">
        <span class="era-tag">Days 1,101 – 2,002 · Modern Web &amp; Tooling</span>
        <h3>Deterministic Platforms &amp; Autonomous AI</h3>
        <p>Creating high-performance Astro-powered web architectures (SM'S DEX), automated GitHub Actions verification bots, RFC-standard Agentic Discovery protocols (llms.txt), and unified SEO intelligence workbenches.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Quantitative Performance &amp; Engineering Metrics</h2>
    <div class="metrics-summary-table-wrap">
      <table class="metrics-summary-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Engineering Dimension</th>
            <th scope="col">Quantitative Achievement</th>
            <th scope="col">Core Technologies &amp; Architecture</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Algorithmic Problem Solutions</th>
            <td><strong>2,680+ verified solutions</strong></td>
            <td>Python, C++, Java, Algorithmic Analysis</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Continuous Coding Streak</th>
            <td><strong>1,250+ days active</strong> (target: 2,002)</td>
            <td>Git, GitHub Actions, Daily Verification</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Enterprise Event Throughput</th>
            <td><strong>5M+ daily streaming events</strong></td>
            <td>Apache Kafka, PySpark, Snowflake, Docker</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Client-Side Engine Footprint</th>
            <td><strong>2.4 KB standalone WebAssembly</strong></td>
            <td>Pure C99, Clang, POSIX, WebAssembly</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Hackathon Recognition</th>
            <td><strong>3rd Place / 200+ Teams</strong> (HackIndia)</td>
            <td>Solidity, ERC-721, Gemini AI Originality Engine</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2>Key Century Milestones &amp; Landmarks</h2>
    <p>
      Below is the chronological directory of century markers, algorithmic breakthroughs, and landmark engineering logs across Shivam Mahajan's daily engineering streak:
    </p>
  </section>
  <DaysTimeline variant={10} />
</EditorialShell>


<style>
  .milestone-deep-prose {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .milestone-eras-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 24px 0 32px;
  }
  .era-card {
    background: var(--panel, #161b22);
    border: 1px solid var(--border, #333);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--time-accent, #ffd75e);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }
  .era-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--time-accent, #ffd75e);
    font-weight: 700;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, "Departure Mono", monospace);
  }
  .era-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .era-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--dim, #959ba8);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .metrics-summary-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 24px 0 32px;
  }
  .metrics-summary-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
    background: var(--panel, #161b22);
    border: 1px solid var(--border, #333);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .metrics-summary-table th, .metrics-summary-table td {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border, #333);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .metrics-summary-table thead th {
    background: #0f131a;
    color: var(--time-accent, #ffd75e);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .metrics-summary-table tbody th {
    color: var(--ink, #fff);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .metrics-summary-table td {
    color: var(--dim, #959ba8);
  }
  .metrics-summary-table td strong {
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
